OL,4,CProtest over social housing workers'   
OL,5,Callowance cut                          
OL,6,GA protest featuring a masked robber    
OL,7,Gand a giant inflatable rat has been    
OL,8,Gheld outside a call centre where a     
OL,9,Gunion claims some workers are set to   
OL,10,Glose a #1,700 a year allowance.        
OL,12,FThe Unite union said the cutting of    
OL,13,Fthe benefit introduced in 2024         
OL,14,Famounted to a 6% pay cut for nearly    
OL,15,F150 staff at the Sanctuary Housing     
OL,16,Foffice in Hull.                        
OL,18,FUnite regional officer Andy Masterman  
OL,19,Fsaid the reduction by the social       
OL,20,Fhousing company would "risk pushing    
OL,21,Fpeople into in-work poverty".          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
