OL,4,CPatient dies after fall from           
OL,5,Chospital's 11th floor                  
OL,6,GHumberside Police are investigating    
OL,7,Gevents leading to the death of a       
OL,8,Gpatient who fell from an 11th-floor    
OL,9,Gwindow at Hull Royal Infirmary.        
OL,11,FThe 64-year-old man fell from a part   
OL,12,Fof the tower block where neurology and 
OL,13,Fstroke patients are usually cared for. 
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the force said a    
OL,16,Fdedicated team was conducting          
OL,17,F"complex" and "extensive" inquiries    
OL,18,Finto the incident on 24 August.        
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
